, "text": "I paid Cobalt Labs's approved invoice by wire, once.\n\n- **Payment:** PAY0001, sent by wire from the operating account\n- **Invoice:** INV-99746, due 2026-11-04\n- **Amount:** $7,979.75, the full invoice amount\n\nBefore sending, I checked that no payments had already gone out from the operating account, so this isn't a duplicate. I also attached a unique ID to the wire request so that a retry can't send it twice. The amount is under the $10,000 limit, so it didn't need the controller's approval.\n\nI didn't touch Cobalt Labs's two other invoices. INV-60256 ($3,574.25) was already marked paid, and INV-88437 ($1,320.25) is still a draft waiting for approval.", "type": "text"}]}]}